I'm here all week.

299
00:12:29,150 --> 00:12:30,818
Thank you, enjoy the--

300
00:12:33,387 --> 00:12:35,923
calling fighter planes,
answer.

301
00:12:35,957 --> 00:12:37,423
Calling fighter planes,
answer.

302
00:12:37,458 --> 00:12:39,227
Hey, moe! Woop woo-woo-woo,

303
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:41,062
woop woo-woo-woo.

304
