abandon ship to where?

368
00:15:06,140 --> 00:15:09,142
--Abandon ship!

369
00:15:09,175 --> 00:15:11,278
Abandon ship immediately!

370
00:15:11,312 --> 00:15:13,013
Abandon ship immediately!

371
00:15:13,047 --> 00:15:15,148
Abandon ship immediately!

372
00:15:15,182 --> 00:15:18,252
