the iceberg exploded.

437
00:17:59,345 --> 00:18:02,783
As the result of a...
Of an atomic bomb.

438
00:18:02,817 --> 00:18:05,652
Hmm, looks like kathie's
medication seems to be working.

439
00:18:05,685 --> 00:18:08,422
...research ship we were using,
killing every one of the crew.

440
00:18:08,455 --> 00:18:10,323
We three were
not on board then.

441
00:18:10,357 --> 00:18:12,225
- And so my daughter and i--
- uh, over here.

442
00:18:12,258 --> 00:18:14,193
...were spared,
and also a young reporter.

443
00:18:14,227 --> 00:18:15,528
Oh, you mean "news stud."

444
00:18:15,562 --> 00:18:16,897
I warn all of you

445
00:18:16,930 --> 00:18:18,865
