466
00:19:01,608 --> 00:19:02,943
No comics.

467
00:19:02,977 --> 00:19:05,345
- What's this?
- [Man hums]

468
00:19:05,378 --> 00:19:08,782
Oh, this is the universal
unsuspecting drunkard

469
00:19:08,815 --> 00:19:10,683
