477
00:19:24,397 --> 00:19:26,500
Oh, andy, it's a ball of fire.

478
00:19:26,533 --> 00:19:29,737
Tell aunt...

479
00:19:29,770 --> 00:19:31,738
Oh, it's one of those pesky
