1308
00:52:47,932 --> 00:52:49,868
- [Chuckles, mutters]
- Ew.

1309
00:52:49,902 --> 00:52:51,302
Sorry.

1310
00:52:53,003 --> 00:52:54,405
Ooh.

1311
00:52:54,438 --> 00:52:56,808
- Hey, I can't see.
- Come on.

1312
00:52:56,842 --> 00:53:00,512
