you saw was gamera.

1325
00:53:33,512 --> 00:53:36,247
- Thank you, miss hathaway.
- Yes. Exactly.

1326
00:53:36,280 --> 00:53:38,817
Oh, as the old saying goes,

1327
00:53:38,850 --> 00:53:41,418
