- Yeah, yeah. Whatever.

1393
00:56:28,653 --> 00:56:30,422
- Must be nice, huh?
- Any fresh fish today?

1394
00:56:30,455 --> 00:56:31,890
Fresh fish?
[Chuckles]

1395
00:56:31,923 --> 00:56:34,125
Nobody eats fresh fish,
just that can stuff,

1396
00:56:34,158 --> 00:56:36,493
