- No, I didn't.

1401
00:56:44,102 --> 00:56:46,603
All right.
Give him back his stones.

1402
00:56:46,637 --> 00:56:49,073
- I threw them away.
- Then you'd better go
and get them,

1403
00:56:49,107 --> 00:56:50,675
