just like those, all right?

1412
00:57:10,895 --> 00:57:13,665
- There aren't any like those.
- Ohh.

1413
00:57:13,698 --> 00:57:16,000
Kenny!

1414
00:57:16,033 --> 00:57:19,037
- He's crazy, crying over
a couple of stones.
- Mm-hmm.

1415
00:57:19,070 --> 00:57:20,705
- Shut up. Beat it.
- [Cracking sound]

1416
00:57:20,738 --> 00:57:21,705
- Aahh!
- My spine!

1417
00:57:21,738 --> 00:57:23,207
It's all right.
Thank you.

1418
00:57:23,240 --> 00:57:25,877
In a way, I'm glad
he threw the stones away.

1419
00:57:25,910 --> 00:57:28,445
Back to
gidget goes to japan.

1420
00:57:30,182 --> 00:57:33,183
- Are you all right?
- [Demonic voice] Go away!

1421
00:57:33,217 --> 00:57:35,220
[Demonic growling]

1422
00:57:35,253 --> 00:57:37,755
Now, don't act like that,
kenny.

1423
00:57:37,788 --> 00:57:40,090
- You're a big boy.
- [Growling continues]

1424
00:57:40,123 --> 00:57:42,993
Sulking like that
isn't gonna bring the stones
back again, you know.

1425
00:57:43,027 --> 00:57:44,895
And there's no easter bunny
either.

1426
00:57:44,928 --> 00:57:47,565
There are lots of other stones.
I'll go looking too.

1427
00:57:47,598 --> 00:57:51,268
All right, kenny?
We'll look together.

1428
00:57:51,302 --> 00:57:54,272
- [Growling, barking]
- Kenny?

1429
00:57:54,305 --> 00:57:56,807
[Imitating dog panting]

1430
00:57:56,842 --> 00:57:59,243
[Chuckles]
Scoundrel.

1431
00:57:59,277 --> 00:58:02,280
[High-pitched voice]
I am the dream warrior.

1432
00:58:02,313 --> 00:58:04,282
[Chuckles]

1433
00:58:04,315 --> 00:58:05,817
Good riddance.

1434
00:58:08,720 --> 00:58:10,087
Hmm.

1435
00:58:13,023 --> 00:58:14,625
- Where are they?
- Boston, I think.

1436
00:58:16,660 --> 00:58:18,630
There's no load of fish today.

1437
00:58:18,663 --> 00:58:21,165
We're going to have to
go into another business.

1438
00:58:21,198 --> 00:58:22,733
- Yeah, sure.
- Yeah, you're right.

1439
00:58:22,767 --> 00:58:25,035
I tell you,
there's something wrong
with the water.

1440
00:58:25,068 --> 00:58:28,238
All those nuclear tests.
They're throwing the tides off.

1441
00:58:28,272 --> 00:58:30,308
It's those scientists.
In a few years,

1442
00:58:30,342 --> 00:58:32,177
