1459
00:59:04,375 --> 00:59:07,212
Ah, this is pearl harbor.
How'd this get in here?

1460
00:59:07,245 --> 00:59:09,680
- Hey.
- Not even supposed to...

1461
00:59:09,713 --> 00:59:11,715
