1559
01:02:49,467 --> 01:02:50,535
No dancing.

1560
01:02:50,568 --> 01:02:51,935
Everybody clear out!

1561
01:02:51,968 --> 01:02:53,203
Everybody clear out!

1562
01:02:53,237 --> 01:02:56,373
Aww.

1563
01:02:56,407 --> 01:02:57,875
Hurry, you hear that?

1564
01:02:57,908 --> 01:03:00,277
It's gamera, hurry!
Hurry! Everybody run!

1565
01:03:00,310 --> 01:03:02,180
Don't you want to live?
Get moving!

1566
01:03:02,213 --> 01:03:04,182
Ah, cool it, will you?
Gamera doesn't scare us.

1567
01:03:04,215 --> 01:03:06,150
Go to bed, old man!

1568
01:03:06,183 --> 01:03:07,985
We're not afraid
