- I said everybody out!
- Disco turtles.

1572
01:03:12,857 --> 01:03:14,892
Have all of you gone crazy?

1573
01:03:14,925 --> 01:03:17,162
Did someone say turtle?

1574
01:03:17,195 --> 01:03:19,863
Look, it's gamera!

1575
01:03:19,897 --> 01:03:21,498
Look!

1576
01:03:21,532 --> 01:03:24,468
Do the gamera!

1577
01:03:24,502 --> 01:03:26,303
Cool.

1578
01:03:26,337 --> 01:03:29,173
- All right,
great drum solo.
- Whoo!

1579
01:03:29,207 --> 01:03:32,210
