leave right away.
- Don't do that.

1626
01:05:47,378 --> 01:05:49,647
Hurry!

1627
01:05:49,680 --> 01:05:52,350
There's still so much work
to be done though, sister.

1628
01:05:54,285 --> 01:05:56,020
Kenny, did you hear
what I said?

1629
01:05:56,053 --> 01:05:58,022
[Servo growls]

1630
01:05:58,055 --> 01:06:00,523
Gamera, it's me, kenny.

1631
01:06:00,557 --> 01:06:02,192
Don't do anything bad.

1632
01:06:02,225 --> 01:06:03,995
I am your bride.

1633
01:06:04,028 --> 01:06:06,430
I hear you, kenny,
and I obey.

1634
01:06:06,463 --> 01:06:08,698
I'm just a soul
whose intentions are good.

1635
01:06:08,732 --> 01:06:12,337
Please lord, don't let me
be misunderstood.

1636
01:06:20,110 --> 01:06:22,547
Here at exxon, we take
the greatest precautions

1637
01:06:22,580 --> 01:06:26,383
