since frame one.

1648
01:06:50,407 --> 01:06:52,042
Kenny!

1649
01:06:52,075 --> 01:06:55,245
Damian? Damian?

1650
01:06:55,278 --> 01:06:57,782
Have another
deviled egg, damian.

1651
01:07:00,785 --> 01:07:02,252
Aah, forget him.

1652
01:07:02,285 --> 01:07:04,322
- Prunes!
- Explain to me,
dr. Hidaka,

1653
01:07:04,355 --> 01:07:06,423
I think the z-plan
must be supervised

1654
