processing plant

1675
01:07:50,533 --> 01:07:52,368
devouring flames,
its favorite food.

1676
01:07:52,402 --> 01:07:54,572
- Mm.
- He likes cajun, go figure.

1677
01:07:54,605 --> 01:07:56,307
--Eight hours,
and at that point,

1678
01:07:56,340 --> 01:07:58,142
gamera will be in a much
weaker condition.

1679
01:07:58,175 --> 01:07:59,643
I vote red dot.

1680
01:07:59,677 --> 01:08:03,347
In that case, to keep the risk
to an absolute minimum,

1681
01:08:03,380 --> 01:08:05,515
