Come on, the war's
a-this-way, pilgrim.

1703
01:09:06,577 --> 01:09:08,212
All right!

1704
01:09:12,415 --> 01:09:13,817
Come ride the little train

1705
01:09:13,850 --> 01:09:16,153
that's going down
the tracks to hell.

1706
01:09:21,758 --> 01:09:23,360
[Crow laughs]

1707
01:09:23,393 --> 01:09:25,628
And-- and that's
the tanks I get?

1708
01:09:25,662 --> 01:09:28,432
- Oh, that's great.
- Ow! Ow!

1709
01:09:28,465 --> 01:09:30,200
- Hey.
